{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QPBgGZfwx3Xa543Nm2hF3K","type":"tool_result","content":"282\t1. Implement `c001` (§2) → eval once → append record → decide (§5).\n283\t2. If c001 correct, implement `c002` (fused tail) → eval → record → decide.\n284\t3. Implement `c003` (sorted/de-padded) → eval → record → decide.\n285\t4. Tune `num_stages` (c004), then tile/warps (c005), then L2 ordering (c006) — one lever each, eval+record+decide.\n286\t5. Trigger `c007` bf16-round only if a canary-only correctness failure occurred.\n287\t6. When stopping criteria (§6) hold, write `SEARCH_COMPLETE` with the reason. Never run `final` without operator"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"84708b82-1793-4117-b276-8f509c6ef623","uuid":"a9017a2a-2d3d-4913-abe5-d7e7152a6588","timestamp":"2026-09-16T18:22:53.028Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/data1/workspace/weihongren/kda-runs/formal-kda-20260916--sol_execbench--L2-012_moe_expert_batched_execution_with_capacity_factor/docs/plan.md","content":"1. Implement `c001` (§2) → eval once → append record → decide (§5).\n2. If c001 correct, implement `c002` (fused tail) → eval → record → decide.\n3. Implement `c003` (sorted/de-padded) → eval → record → decide.\n4. Tune `num_stages` (c004), then tile/warps (c005), then L2 ordering (c006) — one lever each, eval+record+decide.\n5. Trigger `c007` bf16-round only if a canary-only correctness failure occurred.\n6. When stopping criteria (§6) hold, write `SEARCH_COMPLETE` with the reason. Never run `final` without operator","numLines":6,"startLine":282,"totalLines":289}}}
